      "writtenOn": "2025-02-13T09:15:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t know it could be done like this, and I feel this make a lot of sense to do it.\nWe want to recover from a crash, so we should do it here.\n\nThere is another thing that we could do in the system server... let me know what you think:\nI wonder if we also want to enforce that no component are left available when we are turning it down normally. to be clear, I don\u0027t want the system server to fix the mistake of the app not properly cleaning up on a normal shutdown, but I want the phone to crash hard if this happen, to make sure we don\u0027t let the app not cleaning up",
